  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/830",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1. 미니북 만들기-관찰결과를 글과 그림으로 써보기 </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 관찰결과의 서술-정석 &amp; 밍밍 (퇴적암은 자갈이 군데군데 박혀있으며 블라블라)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2. 광물소개지 제작- 형식 없음. 만화 오케이. 그림과 글로 표현하되 구어체로.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a45e86e2b8031405b59716bbce3febddc750835c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a45e86e2b8031405b59716bbce3febddc750835c\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">광물은 다르게 접근. 재미있게 광물을 소개하는 소개서 만들기.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">안녕~ 나</span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f326c3c992acc9b0fab19c0653e919d7266df943?download\" data-file-name=\"광물 스케치 샘플.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2457637\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D830%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20220408164443&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ff326c3c992acc9b0fab19c0653e919d7266df943')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">광물 스케치 샘플</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.34MB</div></div></a></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">는 **(석영이)야. 캐릭터화 시켜서 그림을 그려보자. 예시로 눈그리고 손발 그려 줌.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a05caaffc7afeeb3bc7b27bda3ffd1275d7c5f70\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a05caaffc7afeeb3bc7b27bda3ffd1275d7c5f70\" data-origin-width=\"577\" data-origin-height=\"825\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">방법만 바꿔었을 뿐인데 훨씬 다채로운 결과물을 보여줍니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">형식이 내용을 지배하는구나는 깨.달.음. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이번 주도 수고하셨습니다. 벚꽃잔치가 한창입니다. 누리시기를.</span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/722d454f5d54a5de150fe49ee778b9573121eeca?download\" data-file-name=\"활동 03 암석 미니북.pptx\" data-file-size=\"33154\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D830%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20220408164443&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F722d454f5d54a5de150fe49ee778b9573121eeca')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">활동 03 암석 미니북</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">32.38KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
